**Collision detection implemented.**

I’ve added a fully working **Palace Arena** with real-time collision detection to your CRIMSON SOVEREIGN game. It includes:

- Canvas-based playable area
- Player movement (WASD / Arrow keys)
- Multiple obstacles + other players (via WebSocket)
- Circle-vs-Circle and Circle-vs-Rectangle collision
- Collision response (bounce + damage based on your Attack / Strength stats)
- Visual feedback + log messages
- Works with the existing real-time WebSocket sync

---

