### Result
You now have working **collision detection** between:
- Player ↔ Rectangles
- Player ↔ Circles
- Player ↔ Other players (multiplayer)

Collisions push the player out and log impact force based on your Attack + Strength stats.

Just paste the code sections above into your current `index.html` and the arena will appear and run immediately.